WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Lower rungs assemble while upper rungs remain faint

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.200
Each rung draws its test geometry; its route locks or stops

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.800
The rail snaps into place; mismatched routes stop without spectacle

4
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.400
Two indigo bays brighten; uncertainty widens toward the hard end

5
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.000
The portfolio settles — no universal law, no all-green state
